 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the information in the table below, which gives standard and final quotas for Methods X, Y, and Z.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th><b>State A</b></th>\n<th><b>State B</b></th>\n<th><b>State C</b></th>\n<th><b>State D</b></th>\n<th><b>State E</b></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Standard Quota</b></td>\n<td>1.67</td>\n<td>3.33</td>\n<td>5.00</td>\n<td>6.67</td>\n<td>8.33</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Method X</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Method Y</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Method Z</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n",
